      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<p>We will be calling constituents to get them to call their legislators &nbsp;to demand legislators prioritize the New York Health Act in the 2027 session. Once you RSVP we will add you to the list to receive our zoom link before the calling. We will also be calling our own legislators as well as getting our statewide comrades to call theirs</p><p>Also, you have an option to call at times outside of the 2-4PM slot, if you like. Please reach out to Erl at 646 596 0228</p>",
      "browser_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/statewide-phonebank-for-nyha-dec1",
