      "name": "Saratoga Rally/Presser/Speak Out for New York Health Act",
      "date": "2026-12-05T12:00:00Z",
      "date_formatted": "12:00 PM, Saturday December 5, 2026",
      "month_year": "2026-12",
      "month_label": "December 2026",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<p>This will be a visibility event on the Saturday following the  Democratic assembly retreat &nbsp;and on the eve of the senate retreat. We are demanding that legislators prioritize the New York Health Act in the upcoming session. Earlier in the week we will hold a massive statewide phone-bank for the same purpose.</p>",
